752
00:37:58.375 --> 00:37:59.833
[Azra] <i>Oh, one last thing.</i>

753
00:37:59.916 --> 00:38:02.041
<i>Don't laugh at his jokes so much.</i>

754
00:38:02.125 --> 00:38:03.958
<i>This is the hardest part.</i>

755
00:38:04.041 --> 00:38:06.458
<i>Because when you're really in love,</i>

756
00:38:06.541 --> 00:38:09.333
