760
00:39:05.250 --> 00:39:06.166
[laughing]

761
00:39:06.250 --> 00:39:08.041
<i>Don't laugh at his jokes so much.</i>

762
00:39:09.083 --> 00:39:12.166
Um, it feels so empty now.

763
00:39:13.208 --> 00:39:14.208
[Burak grunts]

764
00:39:14.250 --> 00:39:15.375
[chuckles]

765
00:39:16.500 --> 00:39:19.125
- Come upstairs for some coffee?
- Why not? Sure.

766
00:39:19.958 --> 00:39:23.583
But, um, rain check, perhaps?

767
00:39:23.666 --> 00:39:25.750
I don't think we should rush into that.

768
00:39:25.833 --> 00:39:26.875
[chuckles]

769
00:39:27.375 --> 00:39:28.208
Sure.

770
00:39:28.291 --> 00:39:29.125
Uh.

771
00:39:29.208 --> 00:39:30.833
Uh, right. We shouldn't rush into it.

772
00:39:30.916 --> 00:39:34.208
- Uh, when do you think we could?
- Mm-hmm. I don't really mind.

773
00:39:34.291 --> 00:39:37.833
<i>Don't you ever say that you don't mind.
If you don't care about yourself...</i>

774
00:39:37.916 --> 00:39:38.916
I'll just go inside then.

775
00:39:40.791 --> 00:39:44.000
Okay. Good. You do that.
You go inside, and I'll go upstairs.

776
00:39:44.625 --> 00:39:45.916
- Okay, great.
- Okay.

777
00:39:46.000 --> 00:39:47.708
[chuckles, sighs]

778
00:39:50.083 --> 00:39:51.583
- See you.
- See ya.

779
00:39:52.458 --> 00:39:53.750
[Azra clears throat]

780
00:39:56.500 --> 00:39:57.791
[sighs, groans]

781
00:40:04.208 --> 00:40:05.208
