799
00:40:53.875 --> 00:40:55.833
<i>♪ I've let him go ♪</i>

800
00:40:55.916 --> 00:40:58.041
<i>♪ I hope I won't die alone ♪</i>

801
00:40:58.125 --> 00:41:00.416
<i>♪ Please, please, please ♪</i>

802
00:41:00.500 --> 00:41:02.750
<i>♪ Surrender yourself ♪</i>

803
00:41:02.833 --> 00:41:04.625
<i>♪ Please, please, please ♪</i>

804
00:41:04.708 --> 00:41:06.958
<i>- ♪ For my crime, I ask forgiveness... ♪</i>
- [banging]

805
00:41:07.041 --> 00:41:09.041
<i>♪ Please, please, please ♪</i>

806
00:41:09.125 --> 00:41:10.708
<i>♪ Surrender yourself ♪</i>

807
00:41:11.541 --> 00:41:14.083
<i>- ♪ If you'd just take a step... ♪</i>
- [music stops]

808
00:41:23.041 --> 00:41:26.291
- [beeps]
- [song continues playing]

809
00:41:29.958 --> 00:41:32.041
<i>♪ If you'd just take a step ♪</i>

810
00:41:32.125 --> 00:41:34.041
<i>♪ If you'd just notice... ♪</i>

811
00:41:34.125 --> 00:41:36.500
[in English] You want your coffee black
or with milk?

812
00:41:37.708 --> 00:41:39.041
[Azra] With skim milk!

813
00:41:45.750 --> 00:41:47.166
- [chuckles]
- Coffee?

814
00:41:48.416 --> 00:41:51.250
- How very neighborly of you. [chuckles]
- [door opens]

815
00:41:53.166 --> 00:41:55.916
[gasps] Absolutely not.

816
00:41:56.000 --> 00:41:57.416
