817
00:41:57.500 --> 00:41:59.875
- You really are something.
- [laughing]

818
00:41:59.958 --> 00:42:01.375
I'm begging you, please.

819
00:42:01.458 --> 00:42:04.125
- Please indulge me just one little kiss.
- [laughing]

820
00:42:05.541 --> 00:42:08.416
Well, this is not
the Stone Age anymore, mister.

821
00:42:08.958 --> 00:42:10.583
If you're serious about it,

822
00:42:10.666 --> 00:42:14.583
