and then, you'd get a kiss.

823
00:42:14.666 --> 00:42:15.708
Oh!

824
00:42:16.416 --> 00:42:19.333
Such things are frowned upon
in the 1800s. [laughs]

825
00:42:19.416 --> 00:42:20.958
[door closes]

826
00:42:21.041 --> 00:42:22.375
Where did you come up with that?

827
00:42:22.458 --> 00:42:24.416
- Okay, come in.
- [Burak laughing] The 1800s.

828
00:42:25.750 --> 00:42:26.625
