832
00:42:32.208 --> 00:42:34.750
[coughs, clears throat]

833
00:42:38.083 --> 00:42:39.625
Can't you and I,

834
00:42:41.375 --> 00:42:43.166
I mean, can we just be friends, huh?

835
00:42:43.250 --> 00:42:45.291
Uh, I know, right? [chuckles]

836
00:42:45.375 --> 00:42:47.291
But besides, we're neighbors, bro.

837
00:42:49.666 --> 00:42:50.666
[sighs]

838
00:42:52.291 --> 00:42:54.416
Right, right, sister. Sister.

839
00:42:54.500 --> 00:42:55.833
- [cups clink]
- [Azra sighs]

840
00:42:59.583 --> 00:43:01.208
Well, make yourself comfortable.

841
00:43:02.541 --> 00:43:04.250
Your living room's really cozy.

842
00:43:04.333 --> 00:43:05.708
You tore down the wall?

843
00:43:05.791 --> 00:43:07.458
I mean, for instance,

844
00:43:07.541 --> 00:43:09.458
well, please don't get me wrong.

845
00:43:09.541 --> 00:43:10.750
What? Wrong about what?

846
00:43:10.833 --> 00:43:15.666
Well, I mean, I kind of get it
if she thinks that way of the guests

847
00:43:15.750 --> 00:43:18.750
