Never mind, I mean...

848
00:43:19.500 --> 00:43:21.708
All right, all right.
I see you're still hung up on it.

849
00:43:21.791 --> 00:43:23.041
[sighs]

850
00:43:24.333 --> 00:43:26.416
I think there's a Makbule
hidden inside of you.

851
00:43:26.500 --> 00:43:28.583
Whoa. Why would you say that?

852
00:43:28.666 --> 00:43:30.500
Well, you thought I slept
