853
00:43:30.583 --> 00:43:32.063
Oh, no, I didn't actually think that.

854
00:43:32.125 --> 00:43:34.333
It wasn't me.
I mean, I was saying Makbule thought that.

855
00:43:34.416 --> 00:43:36.500
But why would I think about that? Okay.

856
00:43:36.583 --> 00:43:37.903
All right, this is getting weird.

857
00:43:37.958 --> 00:43:38.958
All right, all right.

858
00:43:39.000 --> 00:43:42.291
So, I can, uh, tell Makbule
how everything turned out in the end.

859
00:43:42.375 --> 00:43:45.166
So, there's an actual answer to that?

860
00:43:46.416 --> 00:43:47.416
