861
00:43:49.000 --> 00:43:50.880
You got curious
about the costumes that evening.

862
00:43:50.958 --> 00:43:53.208
- [grunts]
- [Burak] Or you weren't curious.

863
00:43:54.000 --> 00:43:56.916
You were dying to know. Just dying
to know, and you didn't even ask me.

864
00:43:57.000 --> 00:43:58.125
What kind of woman are you?

865
00:43:58.208 --> 00:44:00.083
Why wouldn't you just tell me
if I was curious?

866
00:44:00.166 --> 00:44:01.083
Because you didn't ask.

867
00:44:01.166 --> 00:44:02.666
It was private business.

868
00:44:03.583 --> 00:44:05.063
I'm not interested in your fantasies.

869
00:44:05.125 --> 00:44:06.125
What fantasy?

870
00:44:06.750 --> 00:44:10.458
You know what I mean.
The costumes and the wigs.

871
00:44:11.208 --> 00:44:12.125
And all the women.

872
00:44:12.208 --> 00:44:13.916
You thought that... [laughing]

873
00:44:14.708 --> 00:44:15.875
You thought those costumes...

874
00:44:16.625 --> 00:44:19.583
You know what, my dear Makbule?
You have really watched too many movies.

875
00:44:19.666 --> 00:44:21.416
[scoffs] You need to stop calling me that.

876
00:44:21.500 --> 00:44:23.125
- [knocking on door]
- [grunts]

877
00:44:23.208 --> 00:44:27.166
- Aha! See? She called the police on us.
- [chuckles]

878
00:44:28.708 --> 00:44:29.875
[sighs]

879
00:44:32.458 --> 00:44:33.291
[exhales]

880
00:44:33.375 --> 00:44:35.666
Azra, please, just listen
to me before you get mad.

881
00:44:35.750 --> 00:44:36.916
