897
00:45:11.666 --> 00:45:13.166
Oh, I'm so sorry.

898
00:45:14.291 --> 00:45:16.666
What if your aunt calls me?
Or she calls the girls?

899
00:45:16.750 --> 00:45:19.375
- She was suspicious the other night.
- See? She's calling me.

900
00:45:19.458 --> 00:45:20.333
Come on, please.

901
00:45:20.416 --> 00:45:23.708
- Please, please, please, please, please.
- Please, please, please.

902
00:45:23.791 --> 00:45:24.958
All right, fine, fine.

903
00:45:25.041 --> 00:45:27.041
- [Hande gasps]
- [Burak chuckles]

904
00:45:27.750 --> 00:45:28.791
Thank you!

905
00:45:32.958 --> 00:45:34.166
[Azra sighs]

906
00:45:34.250 --> 00:45:35.916
Hey, um, if you're worried about her,

907
00:45:36.000 --> 00:45:38.166
we could always
just follow her on my bike.

908
00:45:38.250 --> 00:45:39.500
You really mean it?

909
00:45:40.166 --> 00:45:41.291
Hmm. [chuckles]

910
00:45:41.375 --> 00:45:42.750
Oh, my God, thank you!

911
00:45:47.916 --> 00:45:49.916
Would you be scared
if I rode a little fast?

912
00:45:50.000 --> 00:45:53.000
[Azra panting]

913
00:45:54.458 --> 00:45:56.416
- Well, hop on.
- [whistles]

914
00:45:56.500 --> 00:45:58.500
- [Turkish music playing]
- [vocalizing]

915
00:46:12.208 --> 00:46:14.791
- I'll make it worth your while. Okay?
- Consider it done.

916
00:46:15.333 --> 00:46:17.708
Fellas, where you going?
Leaving without me, huh?

917
00:46:23.541 --> 00:46:26.125
What are they doing?
Why are they on school grounds?

918
00:46:27.375 --> 00:46:28.735
I have to do something about this.

919
00:46:28.791 --> 00:46:31.471
Hey, wait a minute, what are you doing?
You'll only embarrass Hande.

920
00:46:31.500 --> 00:46:33.875
We'll all be embarrassed
if her aunt finds out about this.

921
00:46:34.500 --> 00:46:37.041
There's a whole academic administration
before her aunt.

922
00:46:37.125 --> 00:46:38.875
[exhales] No, they're the same.

923
00:46:38.958 --> 00:46:39.958
Hmm.

924
00:46:41.583 --> 00:46:43.291
[panting] See. There they are!

925
00:46:44.750 --> 00:46:46.041
[Burak grunts]

926
00:46:46.875 --> 00:46:48.791
But you don't have to do this, you know.

927
00:46:48.875 --> 00:46:50.916
I'm definitely not leaving you alone.

928
00:46:51.500 --> 00:46:53.416
[both sighs]

929
00:46:53.500 --> 00:46:55.166
All right, you coming?

930
00:46:55.250 --> 00:46:57.041
Coming. [grunts]

931
00:46:57.625 --> 00:46:59.875
I've never done anything
this crazy before.

932
00:47:00.708 --> 00:47:02.750
Uh, how come we're at school this late?

933
00:47:02.833 --> 00:47:05.500
Just wait. You ain't seen nothing yet.

934
00:47:05.583 --> 00:47:07.916
[both chuckle]

935
00:47:22.541 --> 00:47:24.083
[Azra panting]

936
00:47:24.166 --> 00:47:26.791
By the way, I'm a photographer.

937
00:47:26.875 --> 00:47:27.875
Okay.

938
00:47:27.958 --> 00:47:30.250
- So those girls coming in, they're models.
- Okay.

939
00:47:30.333 --> 00:47:32.333
- So, all those costumes are...
- Oh, no! Security.

940
00:47:32.375 --> 00:47:33.375
- Come on.
- Security?

941
00:47:33.416 --> 00:47:35.583
Move it. [panting]

942
00:47:36.875 --> 00:47:37.875
[panting]

943
00:47:38.625 --> 00:47:41.166
Yeah, those costumes are for photo shoots.

944
00:47:41.250 --> 00:47:43.875
- So what?
- So that means...

945
00:47:43.958 --> 00:47:45.833
That means I don't have a girlfriend.

946
00:47:46.708 --> 00:47:48.000
[both] Ah...

947
00:47:48.791 --> 00:47:51.291
- [chuckles]
- Okay, come on. Let's go.

948
00:47:56.416 --> 00:47:57.416
[Azra panting]

949
00:47:58.916 --> 00:47:59.916
Oh!

950
00:48:07.708 --> 00:48:09.583
Were you jealous of those other girls?

951
00:48:10.166 --> 00:48:12.875
- Who? Me? Oh, God, as if.
- [exhales]

952
00:48:13.500 --> 00:48:16.125
What? I'm not jealous.
What are you even talking about?

953
00:48:16.208 --> 00:48:18.750
I mean, what do those girls have
that should I be jealous of?

954
00:48:18.833 --> 00:48:20.791
Well, nothing at all, of course.

955
00:48:20.875 --> 00:48:24.083
They're only the winner
and the Model of the Year runner-up.

956
00:48:24.166 --> 00:48:25.458
What's there to be jealous of?

957
00:48:25.541 --> 00:48:28.041
- [chuckles]
- [grunts] You're such a jerk.

958
00:48:29.625 --> 00:48:30.625
[chuckling]

959
00:48:31.125 --> 00:48:33.041
But I'd rather be taking your photos,
honestly.

960
00:48:33.625 --> 00:48:34.625
You would?

961
00:48:35.708 --> 00:48:37.208
You're way prettier than they are.

962
00:48:37.291 --> 00:48:38.666
Oh, come on.

963
00:48:38.750 --> 00:48:41.375
- [slow-tempo music playing]
- [vocalizing]

964
00:48:42.625 --> 00:48:43.875
Your elegance,

965
00:48:44.458 --> 00:48:45.458
your beauty.

966
00:48:46.125 --> 00:48:48.416
- [laughing]
- Your smile.

967
00:48:49.416 --> 00:48:52.375
You tilting your head back when you laugh.

968
00:48:56.750 --> 00:48:58.083
And when you're nervous,

969
00:48:59.583 --> 00:49:00.916
biting your own lip.

970
00:49:04.958 --> 00:49:06.791
- [cell phone vibrating]
- [gasps]

971
00:49:08.958 --> 00:49:09.958
It's nothing.

972
00:49:11.958 --> 00:49:13.291
This is from Utku.

973
00:49:14.541 --> 00:49:16.781
We'll be by the pool.
Don't forget to delete the footage.

974
00:49:17.250 --> 00:49:18.916
[man] Leave that to me. It's easy.

975
00:49:19.000 --> 00:49:22.041
- Though I'll watch them before deleting.
- The pool.

976
00:49:40.875 --> 00:49:42.458
[exhales]

977
00:49:53.208 --> 00:49:54.208
How you doing?

978
00:49:55.041 --> 00:49:57.833
- [Azra panting] Yes, there they are.
- [cell phone vibrates]

979
00:49:59.125 --> 00:50:00.833
It's Ülker. [grunts]

980
00:50:01.583 --> 00:50:05.083
Hello, Ülker.
Um, Hande's actually in the bathroom.

981
00:50:05.166 --> 00:50:07.500
Would you mind if I call you in a minute?

982
00:50:07.583 --> 00:50:09.291
Okay, great. Talk to you soon.

983
00:50:10.958 --> 00:50:11.958
Let's go.

984
00:50:31.083 --> 00:50:33.583
Now let's see
how crazy you really are, huh?

985
00:50:34.458 --> 00:50:35.916
- [Hande] Oh.
- Hande!

986
00:50:36.000 --> 00:50:37.875
[gasps] Azra.

987
00:50:37.958 --> 00:50:39.458
[Azra] Why is your phone on silent?

988
00:50:39.541 --> 00:50:42.302
You know how many times I called?
Didn't you think it might be urgent?

989
00:50:43.166 --> 00:50:44.208
[Hande sighs]

990
00:50:45.250 --> 00:50:46.250
Huh?

991
00:50:47.041 --> 00:50:48.961
- No, please.
- Oh, no. I don't wanna bother you.

992
00:50:49.041 --> 00:50:51.250
Well, it's our school,
and it's our pool too.

993
00:50:51.333 --> 00:50:52.583
Why would I be bothered?

994
00:50:53.333 --> 00:50:55.791
[sighs] Hande, grab your things now.
Let's go.

995
00:50:56.875 --> 00:50:58.875
Princess. [exhales]

996
00:50:59.416 --> 00:51:02.041
- [grunts]
- [Hande groans]

997
00:51:05.666 --> 00:51:06.708
[Utku clears throat]

998
00:51:08.416 --> 00:51:09.583
[Azra groans]

999
00:51:12.208 --> 00:51:14.083
[Utku] And who the hell are you, huh?

1000
00:51:16.125 --> 00:51:17.250
What's your problem?

1001
00:51:18.625 --> 00:51:19.500
What's wrong, man?

1002
00:51:19.583 --> 00:51:20.750
Hey, Azra.

1003
00:51:20.833 --> 00:51:22.916
- I was really...
- Seriously, Hande.

1004
00:51:23.750 --> 00:51:25.083
All of this for that asshole?

1005
00:51:25.166 --> 00:51:26.916
- What are you doing?
- [exhales]

1006
00:51:27.000 --> 00:51:30.541
- I really had no idea we'd be... [sighs]
- Enough! It's not about that.

1007
00:51:30.625 --> 00:51:32.625
- [exhales]
- I'm gonna call your aunt now.

1008
00:51:33.666 --> 00:51:35.625
Pretend you just came
out of the shower, okay?

1009
00:51:35.708 --> 00:51:36.708
Utku!

1010
00:51:37.333 --> 00:51:38.750
Come on, bro. Leave it.

1011
00:51:39.375 --> 00:51:42.875
You see, we're all young here
and having fun, huh?

1012
00:51:45.041 --> 00:51:46.875
We have our reasons to be here.

1013
00:51:46.958 --> 00:51:50.500
What I don't get is
why you're at the school this late.

1014
00:51:50.583 --> 00:51:53.416
Huh? Or wait, don't tell me.

1015
00:51:53.500 --> 00:51:55.250
I'll find out anyway.
I got it. Don't worry.

1016
00:51:57.375 --> 00:52:00.458
What are you gonna find out?
Honestly, I'm dying to know that.

1017
00:52:01.041 --> 00:52:02.708
I'll tell you if wanna know so badly.

1018
00:52:03.541 --> 00:52:06.833
I'll find out
what that hag is really up to.

1019
00:52:07.791 --> 00:52:08.958
Oh!

1020
00:52:09.041 --> 00:52:11.958
Is that what you'll do, pretty boy?
Look at you.

1021
00:52:12.583 --> 00:52:15.750
- Dude, it's okay, we don't need this.
- Hmm. This isn't over.

1022
00:52:15.833 --> 00:52:16.833
[kisses]

1023
00:52:18.333 --> 00:52:19.333
That's my point.

1024
00:52:20.833 --> 00:52:21.875
[Utku] Buh-bye.

1025
00:52:22.666 --> 00:52:25.958
- Come on, guys! Aren't we gonna have fun?
- Yes!

1026
00:52:30.833 --> 00:52:33.000
WHEN SHOULD WE DO THE SWIMMING LESSON?

1027
00:52:33.083 --> 00:52:34.250
[sighs]

1028
00:52:37.083 --> 00:52:38.083
Burak.

1029
00:52:41.000 --> 00:52:42.125
[gasps]

1030
00:52:42.208 --> 00:52:43.666
Hey. [chuckles]

1031
00:52:45.916 --> 00:52:47.541
- How are you?
- I'm good. You?

1032
00:52:48.291 --> 00:52:50.916
- I was on my way to you.
- What? I can't hear you.

1033
00:52:51.000 --> 00:52:52.583
I was gonna drop by your place.

1034
00:52:52.666 --> 00:52:56.000
- I don't understand. Go around that way.
- [sighs]

1035
00:52:58.208 --> 00:53:00.958
- [exhales]
- I wanted to ask if you had plans tonight.

1036
00:53:01.041 --> 00:53:02.333
I don't. Why?

1037
00:53:02.416 --> 00:53:05.375
I think it's time to have dinner,
without hiding or fleeing.

1038
00:53:06.416 --> 00:53:08.541
- Or sobering up drunk youth.
- [laughs]

1039
00:53:08.625 --> 00:53:11.125
Just the two of us all alone.
What do you say?

1040
00:53:11.791 --> 00:53:14.208
I think... I think I would like that.

1041
00:53:14.291 --> 00:53:16.166
Sounds great. So, what time then?

1042
00:53:16.250 --> 00:53:19.666
Uh, would you mind
if I called you later after my class?

1043
00:53:19.750 --> 00:53:23.041
Sure. I'm was planning
to visit my folks tonight anyway.

1044
00:53:23.125 --> 00:53:24.291
[chuckles]

1045
00:53:24.375 --> 00:53:26.541
- So I guess we'll be in touch.
- Sure.

1046
00:53:27.333 --> 00:53:28.750
- Hmm.
- See you.

1047
00:53:29.833 --> 00:53:31.041
[Hande chuckling]

1048
00:53:33.333 --> 00:53:34.166
[Azra] Oh.

1049
00:53:34.250 --> 00:53:37.041
I once had a tutor who told me
to never say yes to dates right away,

1050
00:53:37.125 --> 00:53:40.000
but I think we lost her.

1051
00:53:40.083 --> 00:53:41.333
Uh-huh.

1052
00:53:41.416 --> 00:53:44.416
Maybe you should check yourself
before judging me, all right?

1053
00:53:46.125 --> 00:53:47.250
[inhales]

1054
00:53:47.875 --> 00:53:50.958
Azra, listen, I wasn't the one
who wanted to break into the school.

1055
00:53:51.041 --> 00:53:53.958
- I told them. They wouldn't listen to me.
- It's not about that.

1056
00:53:54.541 --> 00:53:57.083
- It's about what then?
- It's about the misconception you have.

1057
00:53:58.416 --> 00:54:01.291
Getting a guy is never about
just getting into bed with him, Hande.

1058
00:54:01.375 --> 00:54:03.375
- That is just a goal in their game.
- [sighs]

1059
00:54:04.625 --> 00:54:06.416
You're confusing me with someone else.

1060
00:54:06.500 --> 00:54:09.833
For me, it was never
about sleeping with him anyway.

1061
00:54:10.333 --> 00:54:11.833
Yeah, but that's what Utku's after.

1062
00:54:12.333 --> 00:54:14.133
Besides, what are you doing
with those people?

1063
00:54:14.166 --> 00:54:17.500
They're idiots. Don't you see?
Didn't you see how they're acting?

1064
00:54:17.583 --> 00:54:20.125
You almost got both of us into trouble.
Huge mistake.

1065
00:54:21.541 --> 00:54:24.041
Why is it my fault when guys act that way?

1066
00:54:24.125 --> 00:54:25.958
I thought we have equal responsibility.

1067
00:54:26.041 --> 00:54:28.625
Men and women aren't equal.
We're in balance.

1068
00:54:28.708 --> 00:54:31.166
Everyone plays their part
to complete what's missing.

1069
00:54:31.250 --> 00:54:32.250
You understand that?

1070
00:54:32.958 --> 00:54:36.666
You know, I'm sick and tired of this ten
rules and regulations for finding love.

1071
00:54:36.750 --> 00:54:39.458
Why am I not allowed
to live the way I wanna live?

1072
00:54:40.750 --> 00:54:41.833
You are allowed.

1073
00:54:43.583 --> 00:54:46.083
But you need to be patient
until you can discover that balance.

1074
00:54:46.666 --> 00:54:48.541
- Just get to know him first.
- [sighs]

1075
00:54:48.625 --> 00:54:50.291
I never liked that boy's behavior anyway.

1076
00:54:51.083 --> 00:54:53.500
- I mean, that thing he did drove me crazy.
- [exhales]

1077
00:54:53.583 --> 00:54:55.791
- Unbuttoning your shirt. Seriously?
- [gasps]

1078
00:54:55.875 --> 00:54:57.166
- Azra.
- [scoffs]

1079
00:54:57.708 --> 00:54:59.208
Utku didn't mean any harm, really.

1080
00:54:59.291 --> 00:55:00.934
- [scoffs]
- He just wanted me to blend in.

1081
00:55:00.958 --> 00:55:03.750
And you know, just have fun with everyone.
That's all.

1082
00:55:03.833 --> 00:55:06.875
Hande, learn to say no to people.

1083
00:55:06.958 --> 00:55:09.000
Don't jump into every idea.

1084
00:55:09.583 --> 00:55:10.583
Like your ideas?

1085
00:55:13.500 --> 00:55:15.333
- [scoffs]
- [cell phone rings]

1086
00:55:15.416 --> 00:55:17.125
UTKUMYLOVE
LET'S HANG OUT SOMETIME

1087
00:55:19.333 --> 00:55:20.708
- Whoa!
- What?

1088
00:55:21.791 --> 00:55:22.791
What?

1089
00:55:23.666 --> 00:55:25.625
- What you just said.
- Oh, what did I say?

1090
00:55:26.208 --> 00:55:27.666
You just said "whoa," Hande.

1091
00:55:29.958 --> 00:55:34.916
Oh, that. I just got an email
for an 85% discount on Russian classics.

1092
00:55:35.000 --> 00:55:37.125
And it's a limited time offer
so I'd better get going.

1093
00:55:37.208 --> 00:55:38.684
- Yeah.
- I should go and check it out.

1094
00:55:38.708 --> 00:55:40.791
Thank you so much.
I'll, uh, talk to you later.

1095
00:55:43.625 --> 00:55:45.041
- [Azra grunts]
- [both chuckle]

1096
00:55:45.625 --> 00:55:47.750
- [chuckles] Bye, Hande. Okay.
- [door closes]

1097
00:55:48.375 --> 00:55:50.625
Oh, I'm late. I'm late. [sighs]

1098
00:55:50.708 --> 00:55:53.000
Who came up with this idea for a trip?

1099
00:55:53.083 --> 00:55:55.125
[woman] Well,
it's just a school trip, Daddy.

1100
00:55:55.208 --> 00:55:58.166
And remember, Mom,
Miss Tuğçe will be with us.

1101
00:55:58.250 --> 00:56:01.916
Bahar, I don't like you staying elsewhere.
You know that.

1102
00:56:02.000 --> 00:56:03.250
I don't like it either. At all.

1103
00:56:03.333 --> 00:56:05.166
İsmail, that's what I just said, no?

1104
00:56:05.250 --> 00:56:08.000
Do you think you're emphasizing it
when you add an "at all?"

1105
00:56:08.083 --> 00:56:10.333
Don't make fun of me
when the kid's here, hon.

1106
00:56:10.416 --> 00:56:13.041
[laughs] Son, where are you?

1107
00:56:13.125 --> 00:56:16.083
Where have you disappeared to?
Come sit with us for a while.

1108
00:56:17.583 --> 00:56:19.333
Don't upset my sister. Come on.

1109
00:56:20.625 --> 00:56:23.000
Just let her do that trip.
What's so wrong with that?

1110
00:56:23.083 --> 00:56:24.683
- Miss Tuğçe will be here soon.
- Mm-hmm.

1111
00:56:24.708 --> 00:56:27.333
I believe, to ask for our permission.
We'll see what will happen.

1112
00:56:28.291 --> 00:56:29.916
Aww, Mom, you're amazing!

1113
00:56:30.000 --> 00:56:32.583
- You are the best mom in the world.
- Oh, ho-ho! [laughing]

1114
00:56:32.666 --> 00:56:35.458
Wait, wait, we didn't say yes yet.
Off to the kitchen.

1115
00:56:45.500 --> 00:56:46.875
[sighs]

1116
00:56:50.416 --> 00:56:51.625
Any good news for me?

1117
00:56:53.458 --> 00:56:54.708
Yes, actually.

1118
00:56:54.791 --> 00:56:57.250
The two of us are gonna have dinner
alone tonight. We'll see.

1119
00:56:57.333 --> 00:56:58.333
Good.

1120
00:57:04.791 --> 00:57:06.916
Are you still mad at me about everything?

1121
00:57:07.791 --> 00:57:09.000
You should be happy.

1122
00:57:09.958 --> 00:57:10.958
I don't understand.

1123
00:57:11.708 --> 00:57:14.875
Well, if I'm angry,
that means there's still hope, right?

1124
00:57:18.041 --> 00:57:19.208
Mom's upset too.

1125
00:57:20.416 --> 00:57:21.875
Is it really only Mom, Dad?

1126
00:57:23.750 --> 00:57:25.791
Go on, help her out, go.

1127
00:57:29.208 --> 00:57:30.375
[Burak sighs]

1128
00:57:30.458 --> 00:57:32.458
[doorbell rings]

1129
00:57:32.541 --> 00:57:34.541
I got it. It's Miss Tuğçe. You go ahead.

1130
00:57:35.708 --> 00:57:36.708
Hmm.

1131
00:57:39.541 --> 00:57:40.541
Come in, come in.

1132
00:57:42.166 --> 00:57:43.541
- [chuckles]
- Is everything ready?

1133
00:57:43.625 --> 00:57:45.666
- Absolutely. Everything's great.
- [gasps]

1134
00:57:45.750 --> 00:57:47.666
- Let's call them out.
- Okay, great.

1135
00:57:47.750 --> 00:57:49.416
Mom, Miss Tuğçe's here.

1136
00:57:49.500 --> 00:57:51.916
- [Azra sighs] Hello.
- Welcome, ma'am.

1137
00:57:52.000 --> 00:57:53.680
We were just about to have a bite. Please.

1138
00:57:53.708 --> 00:57:55.625
[Azra] Oh, no, no,
I don't wanna be a bother.

1139
00:57:55.708 --> 00:57:58.750
- I'm here to talk to you about this trip.
- [mother] Welcome, Miss Tuğçe.

1140
00:57:58.833 --> 00:58:01.208
You're not off the hook
unless you eat with us.

1141
00:58:01.291 --> 00:58:03.791
[Azra] Well, in that case,
I need to use the restroom.

1142
00:58:03.875 --> 00:58:05.392
- You know the way.
- [Azra] Yeah, I do.

1143
00:58:05.416 --> 00:58:06.791
- Thank you.
- [Bahar] Please.

1144
00:58:13.166 --> 00:58:14.166
Thank you.

1145
00:58:14.208 --> 00:58:15.958
Listen, don't suffocate the girl,

1146
00:58:16.041 --> 00:58:18.375
and please don't embarrass her
in front of her teacher.

1147
00:58:18.458 --> 00:58:20.058
She's old enough to go on a school trip.

1148
00:58:20.125 --> 00:58:22.083
Why wouldn't you let her? Just let her go.

1149
00:58:22.166 --> 00:58:25.041
- Even her teacher's come all the way here.
- [timer beeps]

1150
00:58:25.125 --> 00:58:26.416
[mother] Oh, that's the oven.

1151
00:58:26.500 --> 00:58:29.166
- Be a dear and bring the tray, Burak?
- [Burak] Yep.

1152
00:58:29.250 --> 00:58:30.250
[Bahar sighs]

1153
00:58:31.750 --> 00:58:33.541
- Ma'am, here you go.
- [Azra chuckles]

1154
00:58:33.625 --> 00:58:34.916
- Thank you.
- Welcome.

1155
00:58:35.000 --> 00:58:37.291
You were telling us
something before you were interrupted.

1156
00:58:37.375 --> 00:58:40.791
Oh, um, yeah, right.
So it's an ordinary weekend school trip.

1157
00:58:40.875 --> 00:58:43.000
- I'll be with them at all times.
- [Bahar chuckles]

1158
00:58:43.083 --> 00:58:47.083
And we're all gonna, um,
hit the road in, like, about two hours.

1159
00:58:47.166 --> 00:58:49.447
- I'll drive Bahar home on Sunday evening.
- Yes, exactly.

1160
00:58:49.500 --> 00:58:51.708
Um, Miss Tuğçe, this is my brother Burak.

1161
00:58:56.250 --> 00:58:58.958
[mother] Son, put that on the table.

1162
00:59:07.916 --> 00:59:11.333
Miss Tuğçe,
pleased to make your lovely acquaintance.

1163
00:59:11.416 --> 00:59:12.541
[chuckles]

1164
00:59:16.500 --> 00:59:18.708
So, what's this trip's about?

1165
00:59:18.791 --> 00:59:20.208
What?

1166
00:59:21.375 --> 00:59:23.041
[Burak] Whose idea was this trip?

1167
00:59:23.708 --> 00:59:27.041
You said you'd hit the road
in a couple of hours, huh? Am I wrong?

1168
00:59:27.125 --> 00:59:29.005
You don't have any other plans
for today, ma'am?

1169
00:59:29.666 --> 00:59:31.916
- [Azra] Uh...
- [mother] What are you talking about?

1170
00:59:32.000 --> 00:59:34.208
I thought we're against
Bahar staying somewhere else.

1171
00:59:34.291 --> 00:59:35.541
What the...

1172
00:59:35.625 --> 00:59:38.625
- Well, uh...
- [Bahar] Burak.

1173
00:59:40.250 --> 00:59:41.833
This is a lesson for you?

1174
00:59:44.875 --> 00:59:46.125
If you'd excuse me.

1175
00:59:46.208 --> 00:59:48.625
- Oh, certainly. Please, you're excused.
- What are you...

1176
00:59:48.708 --> 00:59:49.708
Burak.

1177
00:59:50.583 --> 00:59:53.500
- Please, you're excused.
- God, what the hell are you doing?

1178
00:59:54.291 --> 00:59:55.333
Miss Tuğçe!

1179
00:59:56.000 --> 00:59:58.642
- [İsmail] Son, what was that about?
- [mother] That was embarrassing.

1180
00:59:58.666 --> 01:00:00.586
I'm being a good brother.
What's wrong with that?

1181
01:00:02.916 --> 01:00:04.333
Burak.

1182
01:00:08.916 --> 01:00:10.583
[thunder crashing]

1183
01:00:11.500 --> 01:00:13.916
Hey, wait a minute,
wait a minute, wait a minute!

1184
01:00:15.083 --> 01:00:17.750
Don't you think you owe me
an explanation, Miss Tuğçe?

1185
01:00:17.833 --> 01:00:20.833
Azra. Or should
I call you "Apartment Three"?

1186
01:00:20.916 --> 01:00:23.333
- Maybe your name's not even Azra.
- No, my name's Azra.

1187
01:00:23.416 --> 01:00:24.958
Wow! Azra's your real name.

1188
01:00:25.041 --> 01:00:26.458
- Well, that's swell!
- Hmm.

1189
01:00:26.541 --> 01:00:27.625
You do what for a living?

1190
01:00:27.708 --> 01:00:29.500
Change names
and deceive families like that?

1191
01:00:29.583 --> 01:00:31.833
Not really. I'm just helping young people.

1192
01:00:33.583 --> 01:00:35.458
- Help young people, you said?
- [sighs]

1193
01:00:36.125 --> 01:00:38.708
Look at the way you look.
You even put a wig and glasses on.

1194
01:00:38.791 --> 01:00:40.333
What are you trying to look like?

1195
01:00:41.708 --> 01:00:44.791
Lady, who are you? Really, who are you?

1196
01:00:44.875 --> 01:00:46.208
I can explain if you just...

1197
01:00:46.291 --> 01:00:48.351
I don't wanna he...
What were you gonna do with Bahar?

1198
01:00:48.375 --> 01:00:50.166
Where were you planning to take my sister?

1199
01:00:50.250 --> 01:00:52.370
- You are not listening.
- Why should I listen to you?

1200
01:00:52.416 --> 01:00:55.250
- Do you realize you lied to me?
- [thunder rumbling]

1201
01:00:56.958 --> 01:00:59.083
You're making money out
of those lies, aren't you?

1202
01:00:59.166 --> 01:01:01.416
- [slow-tempo music playing]
- [vocalizing]

1203
01:01:01.500 --> 01:01:03.291
- [exhales]
- Hey, hang on a minute.

1204
01:01:04.083 --> 01:01:05.083
What's wrong?

1205
01:01:06.041 --> 01:01:08.416
Is it too much for you
to hear the reality of this?

1206
01:01:08.500 --> 01:01:10.875
Well, I guess since you're familiar
with lies.

1207
01:01:11.875 --> 01:01:14.000
This is the reason I didn't tell you.

1208
01:01:14.083 --> 01:01:17.123
This is exactly why Bahar chose to speak
with me, instead of speaking to you.

1209
01:01:18.875 --> 01:01:19.875
What's that mean?

1210
01:01:21.250 --> 01:01:23.541
First of all,
my sister and I are very close.

1211
01:01:23.625 --> 01:01:26.208
At least we were
until you showed up in our lives.

1212
01:01:26.291 --> 01:01:27.291
Is that right?

1213
01:01:28.041 --> 01:01:31.000
These kids need me
because everyone thinks the way you think.

1214
01:01:31.083 --> 01:01:33.351
You think you understand her,
but you don't listen to her.

1215
01:01:33.375 --> 01:01:34.375
Oh, please.

1216
01:01:34.750 --> 01:01:37.041
Hey, Burak.
What do you think you're doing?

1217
01:01:37.125 --> 01:01:38.958
Is it a crime to go on a trip
with my teacher?

1218
01:01:39.041 --> 01:01:41.875
Look, look at you. You're still
lying through your teeth, damn it!

1219
01:01:41.958 --> 01:01:44.125
Go inside, Bahar.
You're making me furious!

1220
01:01:50.208 --> 01:01:51.708
I really wish you'd listen.

1221
01:01:51.791 --> 01:01:54.416
- Hey, who do you think you are, huh?
- [panting]

1222
01:01:54.500 --> 01:01:55.708
Really, who are you?

1223
01:01:55.791 --> 01:01:58.625
You'd think you'd
have an ounce of dignity, just an ounce!

1224
01:01:59.166 --> 01:02:01.126
You're telling me that
you wish I listened to you!

1225
01:02:01.166 --> 01:02:03.375
Why would I ever listen to you, huh, why?

1226
01:02:03.458 --> 01:02:04.916
[engine turns over]

1227
01:02:05.000 --> 01:02:06.666
Why would I ever listen to you?

1228
01:02:06.750 --> 01:02:09.166
Should I listen
to all the lies that you told me?

1229
01:02:13.041 --> 01:02:14.476
<i>- Look at the way you look.</i>
- [sighs]

1230
01:02:14.500 --> 01:02:17.583
[Burak] <i>You even put a wig and glasses on.
What are you trying to look like?</i>

1231
01:02:21.666 --> 01:02:22.875
<i>What do you do for a living?</i>

1232
01:02:22.958 --> 01:02:25.166
<i>Change names
and deceive families like that?</i>

1233
01:02:25.250 --> 01:02:27.833
<i>Who are you? Really, who are you?</i>

1234
01:02:34.041 --> 01:02:36.625
Azra! Azra!

1235
01:02:37.375 --> 01:02:38.375
Azra!

1236
01:02:38.875 --> 01:02:41.458
Damn it, "Azra" what? "Azra" what?
What do you want?

1237
01:02:42.083 --> 01:02:44.083
[panting]

1238
01:02:45.375 --> 01:02:47.875
Makbule, I'm sure you're dying
to know what this is about.

1239
01:02:47.958 --> 01:02:50.333
Don't bother eavesdropping,
I'll tell you everything.

1240
01:02:50.416 --> 01:02:51.416
See this guy?

1241
01:02:51.500 --> 01:02:53.583
This guy's so prejudiced,
he won't even hear me out.

1242
01:02:53.666 --> 01:02:55.583
Wait. Why don't you tell her
from the beginning?

1243
01:02:55.666 --> 01:02:56.791
Why? Would you even listen?

1244
01:02:56.875 --> 01:02:58.666
Makbule, hello. Do you see this girl?

1245
01:02:58.750 --> 01:03:01.750
She walks around in disguise
taking money from families.

1246
01:03:01.833 --> 01:03:04.125
- And she made my sister lie.
- Leave Bahar out of this.

1247
01:03:04.208 --> 01:03:05.541
I wonder who's pulling her in.

1248
01:03:05.625 --> 01:03:08.541
You would understand if you
just listen to me, but you don't listen!

1249
01:03:09.166 --> 01:03:10.500
[exhales]

1250
01:03:11.041 --> 01:03:12.041
[huffs]

1251
01:03:14.541 --> 01:03:15.541
[groans]

1252
01:03:17.166 --> 01:03:19.166
[gasps, sighs]

1253
01:03:21.250 --> 01:03:22.250
[loud bang]

1254
01:03:22.958 --> 01:03:23.958
[sighs]

1255
01:03:30.416 --> 01:03:33.583
[sighs, exhales]

1256
01:03:35.041 --> 01:03:36.208
[sighs]

1257
01:03:37.958 --> 01:03:39.375
[sighing]

1258
01:03:39.458 --> 01:03:41.333
[knocking on door]

1259
01:03:49.958 --> 01:03:50.958
Move.

1260
01:03:52.791 --> 01:03:55.291
[cell phone ringing]

1261
01:03:57.916 --> 01:03:59.875
No, Duygu, I'm really not in the mood...

1262
01:04:02.208 --> 01:04:03.208
What?

1263
01:04:04.875 --> 01:04:07.125
Calm down, calm down. Where are you at?

1264
01:04:08.916 --> 01:04:12.125
Coming. I'll be right there. [gasps]

1265
01:04:12.208 --> 01:04:15.333
You have no idea who Azra is, do you, son?

1266
01:04:15.416 --> 01:04:17.291
- Azra...
- Look, I hear you loud and clear.

1267
01:04:17.375 --> 01:04:19.083
But it's not at all what it seems, okay?

1268
01:04:19.166 --> 01:04:21.625
The girl's right.
You obviously don't listen.

1269
01:04:21.708 --> 01:04:23.791
- But I'm not like you.
- [sighs]

1270
01:04:23.875 --> 01:04:25.583
I listen fine.

1271
01:04:26.625 --> 01:04:29.916
Such things are usually
frowned upon in the 1800s.

1272
01:04:30.583 --> 01:04:31.833
- See?
- [grunts softly]

1273
01:04:32.458 --> 01:04:36.000
How would your sister take dancing classes
at all if it weren't for that girl?

1274
01:04:36.083 --> 01:04:38.250
Dancing you said?
Where did that come from?

1275
01:04:38.333 --> 01:04:41.833
[groans] You really have no idea, do you?

1276
01:04:41.916 --> 01:04:43.750
Wait. How do you even know about this?

1277
01:04:43.833 --> 01:04:47.125
Son, Azra's yapping
on the phone all day long.

1278
01:04:47.208 --> 01:04:49.875
And the walls are paper thin.

1279
01:04:49.958 --> 01:04:52.541
Wait a minute, wait.
So, Bahar is aspiring to be a dancer?

1280
01:04:52.625 --> 01:04:54.458
She's already a dancer.

1281
01:04:55.041 --> 01:04:55.916
[Burak hesitates]

1282
01:04:56.000 --> 01:04:59.541
You really don't know the kind of money
your parents have been paying Azra?

1283
01:04:59.625 --> 01:05:02.333
Azra has been using that
for dancing classes.

1284
01:05:02.416 --> 01:05:05.208
- [groans]
- [Makbule] There's a contest this weekend.

1285
01:05:05.291 --> 01:05:07.125
- What, a dance contest?
- Mm-hmm.

1286
01:05:07.750 --> 01:05:08.750
[Burak grunts]

1287
01:05:16.708 --> 01:05:17.833
[Azra sighs]

1288
01:05:17.916 --> 01:05:20.708
How could you send pictures
to someone you met online, Duygu?

1289
01:05:21.291 --> 01:05:22.875
Who is he? Have you met him in person?

1290
01:05:23.625 --> 01:05:25.708
Romantic Vagabond or something.
I don't know.

1291
01:05:25.791 --> 01:05:26.875
That's all?

1292
01:05:26.958 --> 01:05:29.666
- [sniffles]
- You sent nudes to someone you don't know?

1293
01:05:30.166 --> 01:05:32.000
You can't do that, Duygu!

1294
01:05:32.083 --> 01:05:35.458
He's the one that's blackmailing me,
but it is my fault now?

1295
01:05:36.000 --> 01:05:37.083
[Azra exhales]

1296
01:05:38.083 --> 01:05:39.333
Did you send him any money?

1297
01:05:39.958 --> 01:05:42.000
- [sniffles] I did.
- Hmm.

1298
01:05:42.666 --> 01:05:44.875
I did, but it's never enough.
He wants more.

1299
01:05:45.708 --> 01:05:49.208
He's already posted a photo
of me with my face blurred out.

1300
01:05:49.291 --> 01:05:51.750
That's why I called you in a panic.

1301
01:05:51.833 --> 01:05:55.875
He says if I don't pay him right now,
he'll share my face and my name tomorrow.

1302
01:05:55.958 --> 01:05:57.791
- Can't believe this jerk.
- [sobbing]

1303
01:05:57.875 --> 01:06:00.541
Duygu, how do you always manage
to find guys like this, huh?

1304
01:06:01.958 --> 01:06:03.083
I have no idea.

1305
01:06:04.541 --> 01:06:05.541
[Azra sighs]

1306
01:06:06.458 --> 01:06:08.291
Why didn't you ask me to help you?

1307
01:06:08.791 --> 01:06:10.458
Why didn't you talk to me?

1308
01:06:10.541 --> 01:06:12.250
[Bahar] <i>Because I was all alone, Burak.</i>

1309
01:06:12.333 --> 01:06:15.208
<i>And it fell on my shoulders
to fulfill my dreams.</i>

1310
01:06:16.250 --> 01:06:17.958
<i>You don't get Azra at all.</i>

1311
01:06:19.041 --> 01:06:20.541
<i>And what she means for us.</i>

1312
01:06:20.625 --> 01:06:24.208
<i>She was there for me when you were not.
She's been like a big sister to me.</i>

1313
01:06:24.291 --> 01:06:25.833
<i>She's a good person.</i>

1314
01:06:25.916 --> 01:06:28.958
<i>She's doing good for all of us,
and you need to realize that.</i>

1315
01:06:31.625 --> 01:06:33.625
If you're in there, can we talk, please?

1316
01:06:37.250 --> 01:06:38.916
Azra, can you hear me?

1317
01:06:39.541 --> 01:06:42.500
- [slow-tempo music playing]
- [vocalizing]

1318
01:06:47.000 --> 01:06:48.708
What if you asked your parents
to help you?

1319
01:06:48.791 --> 01:06:51.791
Oh, you're right.
How could I not think of that?

1320
01:06:52.583 --> 01:06:55.166
Wow, but how could I tell them, right?

1321
01:06:55.250 --> 01:06:57.458
You were peeling oranges
in the living room,

1322
01:06:57.541 --> 01:07:00.333
and I went into my room
and sent nudes, huh?

1323
01:07:01.291 --> 01:07:03.541
Huh? My dad would have a heart attack,

1324
01:07:03.625 --> 01:07:05.666
and my mom would die of embarrassment too.
Get it?

1325
01:07:08.750 --> 01:07:11.083
What if he shares? [sobbing]

1326
01:07:11.166 --> 01:07:13.750
What if they see it? [blubbers]

1327
01:07:15.041 --> 01:07:16.166
[Azra] It's okay.

1328
01:07:16.250 --> 01:07:20.208
They'll either kill him or me.
I can't take this anymore.

1329
01:07:20.291 --> 01:07:21.583
Stop. That is nonsense.

1330
01:07:21.666 --> 01:07:23.875
Maybe I should give him more money.

1331
01:07:23.958 --> 01:07:27.333
- But I... I can't take this anymore, Azra.
- Stop it. What are you doing?

1332
01:07:27.416 --> 01:07:30.750
- I can't take it.
- Shh! Calm down. Calm down. Calm down.

1333
01:07:30.833 --> 01:07:32.458
I'm here for you, okay? Don't you worry.

1334
01:07:32.541 --> 01:07:34.833
We'll figure this out together,
but you need to trust me.

1335
01:07:34.916 --> 01:07:36.333
- Promise?
- Promise.

1336
01:07:36.416 --> 01:07:38.416
[Bahar continues sobbing]

1337
01:07:41.291 --> 01:07:42.500
[gasps]

1338
01:07:45.416 --> 01:07:48.125
Emergency. Grab your gear
and come to my place.

1339
01:07:52.958 --> 01:07:56.541
Nothing. I ravaged the guy's machine,
but there's nothing to be found.

1340
01:07:56.625 --> 01:07:58.708
I'm sure he's storing them
on a hard drive somewhere.

1341
01:07:58.791 --> 01:08:01.583
How could you still
not find out who he is, huh?

1342
01:08:02.458 --> 01:08:05.333
- Hmm. Hold on.
- What?

1343
01:08:06.000 --> 01:08:09.166
- [Cansu] Aha!
- Tell me what's going on. Come on.

1344
01:08:11.083 --> 01:08:13.291
Girl, wait a second. It's not easy.

1345
01:08:13.875 --> 01:08:15.750
The guy set up a security system
at his place.

1346
01:08:15.833 --> 01:08:18.291
If we can log onto it
through the computer, we're golden.

1347
01:08:18.375 --> 01:08:20.625
- That's it, girl!
- [chuckles]

1348
01:08:20.708 --> 01:08:24.416
So what are we waiting for? Log into it.
Maybe we can see where the hard drive is.

1349
01:08:25.000 --> 01:08:26.916
Wow, that's a brilliant idea, actually.

1350
01:08:27.000 --> 01:08:29.375
I'm doing wonders here.
Can I have my congratulations first?

1351
01:08:29.458 --> 01:08:32.041
- All right, good job, good job.
- Congratulations.

1352
01:08:32.125 --> 01:08:33.166
[Cansu] Hmm.

1353
01:08:35.333 --> 01:08:36.416
Okay, we're in.

1354
01:08:37.875 --> 01:08:38.916
The guy's not home.

1355
01:08:40.166 --> 01:08:41.500
I bet he's on the prowl.

1356
01:08:43.791 --> 01:08:47.541
Though this place looks really familiar,
doesn't it?

1357
01:08:47.625 --> 01:08:49.333
[Duygu] Maybe you've seen it on a TV show?

1358
01:08:49.416 --> 01:08:51.375
[Cansu] Yeah, maybe.
It looks familiar to me too.

1359
01:08:51.458 --> 01:08:53.583
- [gasps] Shit.
- Oh, shit!

1360
01:08:53.666 --> 01:08:56.416
- What did you just see? Oh!
- [Azra grunts]

1361
01:08:56.500 --> 01:08:58.791
- That's Utku's place.
- Yep, that's the one.

1362
01:09:00.083 --> 01:09:03.833
I told you the place looked familiar,
didn't I? [sighs]

1363
01:09:04.375 --> 01:09:07.166
So now we know
where he gets the money to live like this.

1364
01:09:07.250 --> 01:09:08.416
Money from people like me.

1365
01:09:09.500 --> 01:09:12.083
And I was at that jerk's party!
Good for me, right?

1366
01:09:12.166 --> 01:09:15.458
Seriously, you all should congratulate me.
I'm such a stupid idiot!

1367
01:09:15.541 --> 01:09:18.375
And Hande's after this guy. [sighs]

1368
01:09:19.750 --> 01:09:21.708
Damn, she will be devastated. [sighs]

1369
01:09:22.458 --> 01:09:24.083
How am I gonna tell her about this?

1370
01:09:24.833 --> 01:09:26.916
Well, we'll figure out a way,
I suppose. [exhales]

1371
01:09:27.000 --> 01:09:28.625
You should be happy she dodged a bullet.

1372
01:09:28.708 --> 01:09:30.308
- I mean, can you imagine?
- No, shut up.

1373
01:09:30.333 --> 01:09:32.166
I don't even wanna think about it.

1374
01:09:32.250 --> 01:09:33.500
- Ugh, damn.
- Wow!

1375
01:09:33.583 --> 01:09:35.041
Just what we needed right now.

1376
01:09:35.625 --> 01:09:37.250
- [sighing]
- That's just great.

1377
01:09:37.791 --> 01:09:39.500
But all the other buildings have power.

1378
01:09:39.583 --> 01:09:41.916
[Azra] I know.
This is a problem with our building.

1379
01:09:42.500 --> 01:09:45.166
It's old, and they still
haven't renewed the wiring.

1380
01:09:45.250 --> 01:09:48.416
Oh, damn. Girls,
I have more good news for you, it seems.

1381
01:09:48.500 --> 01:09:50.416
- What?
- My battery's dying.

1382
01:09:50.500 --> 01:09:52.375
Why, you ask? Because Murphy!

1383
01:09:52.458 --> 01:09:54.958
Oh, that's okay.
Now we know who it is, right?

1384
01:09:55.041 --> 01:09:58.041
We're okay. I'll go down
and check the circuit breaker.

1385
01:09:58.125 --> 01:10:00.125
- Okay, fine. You go.
- [Cansu softly grunts]

1386
01:10:00.208 --> 01:10:01.500
[Duygu exhales]

1387
01:10:05.166 --> 01:10:07.416
[upbeat music playing]

1388
01:10:13.791 --> 01:10:15.708
FOLLOW THE THREAD

1389
01:10:32.875 --> 01:10:34.875
[vocalizing]

1390
01:10:35.583 --> 01:10:36.583
[Azra] Burak?

1391
01:11:03.041 --> 01:11:04.041
Burak?

1392
01:11:09.708 --> 01:11:11.333
PRESS THE BUTTON

1393
01:11:17.791 --> 01:11:18.708
[clicks]

1394
01:11:18.791 --> 01:11:22.375
["Varsa Yoksa" by Birkan Nasuhoğlu
and Elçin Orçun playing]

1395
01:11:26.708 --> 01:11:28.166
I CANNOT FACE YOU

1396
01:11:28.250 --> 01:11:29.250
[sighs]

1397
01:11:32.708 --> 01:11:34.375
I DON'T WANT TO BREAK YOUR HEART

1398
01:11:38.416 --> 01:11:40.083
I THINK I'M BAD AT APOLOGIES

1399
01:11:48.916 --> 01:11:50.625
I WAS AN ASS! WILL YOU FORGIVE ME?

1400
01:11:51.208 --> 01:11:53.041
[laughing]

1401
01:11:53.541 --> 01:11:54.666
[sighs]

1402
01:11:56.250 --> 01:11:58.208
- [Burak grunts]
- [laughing]

1403
01:11:59.041 --> 01:12:00.916
[Burak] I've been a jackass. I know.

1404
01:12:01.875 --> 01:12:02.916
Will you forgive me?

1405
01:12:03.000 --> 01:12:06.000
You look ridiculous.
Come on, take that thing off now.

1406
01:12:06.083 --> 01:12:08.916
When did you even set all this up?
You shouldn't go to all the trouble.

1407
01:12:09.000 --> 01:12:12.041
- Azra, I was just too slow to catch up.
- [cell phone ringing]

1408
01:12:13.375 --> 01:12:15.625
But now I realize,
I didn't know you at all.

1409
01:12:15.708 --> 01:12:17.791
- If you give me one chance, I promise...
- Listen.

1410
01:12:17.875 --> 01:12:20.125
Burak, I'm so sorry,
but this is very important.

1411
01:12:20.208 --> 01:12:21.958
I really need to take this.

1412
01:12:22.041 --> 01:12:24.083
Yes, Cansu, I'm listening.

1413
01:12:25.541 --> 01:12:28.875
What? Oh, okay, I'm coming. I'm so sorry.

1414
01:12:28.958 --> 01:12:31.375
I have to go. [panting]

1415
01:12:35.083 --> 01:12:36.875
I can't even apologize properly.

1416
01:12:37.916 --> 01:12:40.958
[panting] Cansu, are you sure?
How do you know?

1417
01:12:41.041 --> 01:12:42.666
Of course I'm sure. Check this out.

1418
01:12:42.750 --> 01:12:43.750
Here.

1419
01:12:44.375 --> 01:12:46.291
[Azra] Oh, no. That's Hande.

1420
01:12:46.375 --> 01:12:47.791
I don't believe this.

1421
01:12:48.291 --> 01:12:51.166
How could you go
to that guy's place without telling me?

1422
01:12:51.250 --> 01:12:52.458
[exhales]

1423
01:12:53.875 --> 01:12:56.708
- Hande, answer it.
- [Duygu] She hung up!

1424
01:12:57.916 --> 01:13:00.726
Know what? If she finds that hard drive,
all our troubles would be over.

1425
01:13:00.750 --> 01:13:02.910
That hard drive is not
our only problem anymore, Cansu.

1426
01:13:07.708 --> 01:13:09.916
- [Hande sighs, chuckles]
- [lighter clicks]

1427
01:13:10.500 --> 01:13:14.458
So, what would you like?
Whiskey, wine, fruit juice?

1428
01:13:14.541 --> 01:13:15.750
Fruit juice.

1429
01:13:15.833 --> 01:13:17.541
- [Utku] Mm.
- Uh, or wine.

1430
01:13:17.625 --> 01:13:19.583
- White or red?
- Red, please.

1431
01:13:20.166 --> 01:13:21.166
Right away.

1432
01:13:22.666 --> 01:13:24.583
[cell phone vibrating]

1433
01:13:30.375 --> 01:13:33.041
- [Azra] <i>Hello, Hande.</i>
- I'm listening, Azra.

1434
01:13:33.125 --> 01:13:34.375
<i>What are you doing over there?</i>

1435
01:13:34.458 --> 01:13:36.666
Uh, what am I doing where?
What do you mean?

1436
01:13:36.750 --> 01:13:38.625
Hande, I know you're at Utku's place.

1437
01:13:38.708 --> 01:13:40.916
Utku is not who you think.
You need to get out of there.

1438
01:13:41.000 --> 01:13:43.500
No, Azra, you're being ridiculous,
just like my aunt.

1439
01:13:43.583 --> 01:13:44.708
[Utku] Do you like almonds?

1440
01:13:45.416 --> 01:13:46.541
Uh, sure.

1441
01:13:47.958 --> 01:13:50.000
Look, I'm here.
I'm okay, and everything's...

1442
01:13:50.083 --> 01:13:51.000
Uh, hello? Hey, Azra.

1443
01:13:51.083 --> 01:13:53.803
- I think you're breaking up now.
<i>- Hande, wait, wait. Don't hang up!</i>

1444
01:13:54.458 --> 01:13:57.208
She hung up. [huffs]

1445
01:14:04.666 --> 01:14:06.583
Maybe like this? No, come on, really.

1446
01:14:18.541 --> 01:14:19.958
[typing]

1447
01:14:20.041 --> 01:14:22.226
Wait a minute.
I'm getting a different signal right now.

1448
01:14:22.250 --> 01:14:24.208
Wait. What do you mean different signal?

1449
01:14:25.416 --> 01:14:26.625
Oh, shit!

1450
01:14:26.708 --> 01:14:27.875
What's wrong?

1451
01:14:29.000 --> 01:14:31.392
- Azra, this one's bad.
- Just tell me what's going on, Cansu!

1452
01:14:31.416 --> 01:14:32.541
Hey, hang on a second, okay?

1453
01:14:34.625 --> 01:14:36.500
Look, the guy has other cameras
in his house.

1454
01:14:36.583 --> 01:14:38.541
So he's not only using photos
for blackmail.

1455
01:14:38.625 --> 01:14:40.505
- He's recording himself as well.
- [Azra gasps]

1456
01:14:50.458 --> 01:14:51.458
[chuckles]

1457
01:14:52.541 --> 01:14:54.125
Did you do something to your hair?

1458
01:14:54.208 --> 01:14:56.250
- [chuckles]
- Hmm? It's very beautiful.

1459
01:14:56.333 --> 01:14:58.833
[Azra] Hande. What are they doing?

1460
01:15:00.291 --> 01:15:01.875
This is not good.

1461
01:15:02.625 --> 01:15:04.416
This house seems
to be in a strange location.

1462
01:15:04.500 --> 01:15:06.625
Do you think I could find it if I go now?

1463
01:15:06.708 --> 01:15:08.708
Hey, Cansu,
can you get the location for me?

1464
01:15:08.791 --> 01:15:10.375
Sure, let me jump into that.

1465
01:15:10.458 --> 01:15:12.750
Azra, do you even realize
what you're asking me to do?

1466
01:15:12.833 --> 01:15:15.753
If I could do that, I'd be working
for the FBI right about now. Seriously.

1467
01:15:15.833 --> 01:15:17.125
You don't need to get riled up.

1468
01:15:17.208 --> 01:15:18.888
- But you're driving me nuts...
- I got it!

1469
01:15:18.958 --> 01:15:20.916
I got it! He texted me
the location of the house.

1470
01:15:21.000 --> 01:15:22.625
You're amazing. Can you send it to me?

1471
01:15:24.166 --> 01:15:26.041
- I texted you.
- [Azra exhales] Okay.

1472
01:15:26.541 --> 01:15:29.125
- I think they're about to make out now.
- What?

1473
01:15:30.833 --> 01:15:31.875
[Hande chuckles]

1474
01:15:34.791 --> 01:15:35.791
Oh.

1475
01:15:37.458 --> 01:15:38.666
Can I maybe have some water?

1476
01:15:39.250 --> 01:15:40.833
- Water.
- Water.

1477
01:15:42.500 --> 01:15:44.750
Definitely, princess. Water.

1478
01:15:46.250 --> 01:15:48.708
[clears throat] Hmm.

1479
01:15:50.291 --> 01:15:51.666
Hande. [sighs]

1480
01:15:53.166 --> 01:15:55.541
How could I have made
such a terrible mistake?

1481
01:15:56.125 --> 01:15:57.208
[Duygu groans]

1482
01:15:58.291 --> 01:16:00.750
- Guys, I think she saw it.
- [Azra] Huh?

1483
01:16:01.916 --> 01:16:04.208
She found it.
She found it. She found the camera.

1484
01:16:08.166 --> 01:16:09.583
Shit. [inhales]

1485
01:16:10.500 --> 01:16:11.500
[groans]

1486
01:16:17.083 --> 01:16:18.458
Shit, shit, shit.

1487
01:16:24.458 --> 01:16:26.458
God. [panting]

1488
01:16:27.375 --> 01:16:29.916
Princess, where are you going?

1489
01:16:31.583 --> 01:16:33.916
Uh, I have the smallest bladder.

1490
01:16:34.000 --> 01:16:36.708
- Water just goes right through me, so...
- Water?

1491
01:16:39.208 --> 01:16:41.541
- [Hande gulps]
- [chuckles]

1492
01:16:43.000 --> 01:16:44.791
Uh, is there a bathroom I can use?

1493
01:16:45.375 --> 01:16:48.625
- Yeah, it's just upstairs. I can show you.
- No. I'm good, going now.

1494
01:16:48.708 --> 01:16:49.708
Thank you so much.

1495
01:16:50.458 --> 01:16:51.500
[chuckles]

1496
01:16:52.208 --> 01:16:53.208
Oh, shit.

1497
01:16:55.250 --> 01:16:56.250
[groans]

1498
01:16:57.750 --> 01:16:59.708
[Utku] It's the last door on the right.

1499
01:17:00.375 --> 01:17:02.083
Um, got it. Got it.

1500
01:17:15.583 --> 01:17:17.541
[clicks]

1501
01:17:19.666 --> 01:17:21.666
Hey, Azra, she's calling you.

1502
01:17:21.750 --> 01:17:23.166
- [cell phone rings]
- [Azra grunts]

1503
01:17:23.250 --> 01:17:24.625
Hello, Hande.

1504
01:17:24.708 --> 01:17:26.788
[Hande] <i>Azra, Azra,
there are hidden cameras in here.</i>

1505
01:17:26.833 --> 01:17:29.625
Okay, listen. Listen to me. Calm down.
Look, we can see you right now.

1506
01:17:29.708 --> 01:17:32.625
<i>What? You can see me? Uh, but where?</i>

1507
01:17:33.458 --> 01:17:35.208
<i>Oh, my God, this is too much!</i>

1508
01:17:36.458 --> 01:17:38.458
<i>This guy's such a pervert!</i>

1509
01:17:38.541 --> 01:17:40.791
<i>What the hell! I can't believe this.</i>

1510
01:17:41.625 --> 01:17:42.791
What a pervert!

1511
01:17:51.583 --> 01:17:52.583
Hey, Azra.

1512
01:17:53.083 --> 01:17:56.500
What if... what if he put
some drug into my water?

1513
01:17:56.583 --> 01:17:59.208
What if I pass out here?
What will my aunt say about this?

1514
01:17:59.291 --> 01:18:01.416
<i>Oh, my God, come here.
Just come get me, please.</i>

1515
01:18:01.500 --> 01:18:02.875
Guys, you two keep track of her.

1516
01:18:02.958 --> 01:18:05.666
Hande, whatever happens,
do not leave that bathroom, okay?

1517
01:18:05.750 --> 01:18:08.916
I'll be damned if I don't give
that guy a piece of my mind. [exhales]

1518
01:18:10.500 --> 01:18:13.000
- [sighs]
- Burak, this is not the time.

1519
01:18:13.083 --> 01:18:14.833
I gotta run. So sorry.

1520
01:18:14.916 --> 01:18:16.875
But can you at least
tell me where you're going?

1521
01:18:16.958 --> 01:18:18.833
Yeah, I'll call you. [panting]

1522
01:18:22.666 --> 01:18:25.125
Hande. Hande, are you all right?

1523
01:18:25.208 --> 01:18:27.267
[Hande] <i>My battery's about to die.
My phone will die</i>.

1524
01:18:27.291 --> 01:18:29.125
<i>- I'm sure of it!</i>
- Calm down. I'm on my way.

1525
01:18:29.208 --> 01:18:31.708
I'll be there very soon. [groans]

1526
01:18:31.791 --> 01:18:33.625
[horn honks]

1527
01:18:33.708 --> 01:18:34.958
Move, damn it!

1528
01:18:45.875 --> 01:18:47.000
Princess?

1529
01:18:55.708 --> 01:18:56.708
Princess?

1530
01:18:57.291 --> 01:18:58.916
I'm not your princess! Oh, God!

1531
01:19:03.416 --> 01:19:04.625
[sighs]

1532
01:19:06.208 --> 01:19:08.166
Princess!

1533
01:19:11.666 --> 01:19:13.708
Uh-oh. I don't think she'll make it.

1534
01:19:15.041 --> 01:19:16.791
Come on, Azra, come on!

1535
01:19:18.625 --> 01:19:20.166
Damn it, Hande, come on!

1536
01:19:22.666 --> 01:19:24.041
- [lock rattles]
- Princess.

1537
01:19:27.125 --> 01:19:29.666
[sighs] Come on, don't keep me waiting.

1538
01:19:33.583 --> 01:19:34.875
Hande, are you okay?

1539
01:19:34.958 --> 01:19:36.333
Do you need anything?

1540
01:19:36.416 --> 01:19:38.208
[whispers] Oh, my God. I can't believe it.

1541
01:19:50.791 --> 01:19:52.458
What are you doing in the bathroom?

1542
01:19:53.833 --> 01:19:55.458
What are you doing in here, Utku?

1543
01:19:56.541 --> 01:19:59.083
[chuckles] What...
what the hell are you talking about?

1544
01:19:59.166 --> 01:20:00.708
I saw all the hidden cameras!

1545
01:20:02.750 --> 01:20:05.458
Will you open up for me?
What have you been dreaming up, princess?

1546
01:20:05.541 --> 01:20:07.916
I can't believe
you're still calling me that.

1547
01:20:08.000 --> 01:20:10.791
You're still calling me princess, damn it!

1548
01:20:11.750 --> 01:20:13.583
And I thought you actually liked me.

1549
01:20:13.666 --> 01:20:14.958
I thought, "This is it."

1550
01:20:15.041 --> 01:20:17.166
"Finally, I found
someone to open up my heart."

1551
01:20:17.250 --> 01:20:19.541
All you're interested in
is opening up other parts of me!

1552
01:20:19.625 --> 01:20:20.833
Publicly, huh?

1553
01:20:21.333 --> 01:20:23.541
Spare me the big words and open up.

1554
01:20:24.416 --> 01:20:26.625
- Hande, open up this door, Hande!
- [gasps]

1555
01:20:27.208 --> 01:20:28.416
Open the damn door!

1556
01:20:29.500 --> 01:20:30.500
[exhales]

1557
01:20:31.125 --> 01:20:33.375
Hey, look,
if you're gonna stay locked in there,

1558
01:20:33.458 --> 01:20:35.041
why did you chase after me, huh?

1559
01:20:35.125 --> 01:20:37.250
You were following me everywhere,
like a stray cat!

1560
01:20:37.333 --> 01:20:38.493
Now you're getting cold feet?

1561
01:20:38.541 --> 01:20:41.291
[Hande] You've got yourself
in big trouble. I'm serious.

1562
01:20:41.375 --> 01:20:43.083
Hey, who do think you're threatening, huh?

1563
01:20:43.166 --> 01:20:44.333
- Who do you trust?
- [gasps]

1564
01:20:44.416 --> 01:20:47.083
Who the hell are your people?
Who the fuck are you?

1565
01:20:47.166 --> 01:20:49.351
Look, if you think that aunt
of yours has got your back.

1566
01:20:49.375 --> 01:20:51.750
- I swear to God, I'm gonna fucking...
- [doorbell ringing]

1567
01:20:55.666 --> 01:20:57.666
[continues ringing]

1568
01:20:57.750 --> 01:20:59.750
[panting]

1569
01:21:01.458 --> 01:21:03.250
- [gasps]
- [ringing continues]

1570
01:21:05.125 --> 01:21:06.875
- [lock rattles]
- [gasps]

1571
01:21:07.625 --> 01:21:09.916
Please, Azra, I'm here! I'm upstairs!

1572
01:21:16.375 --> 01:21:18.375
Well, well, who do we have here?

1573
01:21:18.458 --> 01:21:20.791
- You asshole!
- [grunts] Get the hell out of here!

1574
01:21:20.875 --> 01:21:23.333
[grunting]

1575
01:21:23.416 --> 01:21:24.625
- [Utku shouts]
- [shattering]

1576
01:21:24.708 --> 01:21:26.958
Thanks to you,
I couldn't even apologize properly!

1577
01:21:27.666 --> 01:21:30.041
- You can consider yourself forgiven.
- [banging]

1578
01:21:30.125 --> 01:21:31.125
[Azra gasps]

1579
01:21:31.916 --> 01:21:33.976
- [Hande] Azra, I'm up here!
- What is it, huh? What?

1580
01:21:34.000 --> 01:21:36.083
- Are you guys nuts?
- Not really. Why?

1581
01:21:36.166 --> 01:21:37.625
What do you want from me? [shouts]

1582
01:21:37.708 --> 01:21:40.458
You remember the other day
when you were asking me who we were?

1583
01:21:40.541 --> 01:21:41.625
[grunts]

1584
01:21:41.708 --> 01:21:43.250
- [Duygu gasps]
- Ooh! [chuckles]

1585
01:21:43.833 --> 01:21:44.875
[Utku grunts]

1586
01:21:44.958 --> 01:21:46.708
- You understand who we are now?
- [groans]

1587
01:21:46.791 --> 01:21:49.541
- [Azra] Are you all right?
- I'm all right. I'm okay.

1588
01:21:50.041 --> 01:21:53.583
[exhales] First dates
are really hard, huh?

1589
01:21:53.666 --> 01:21:55.458
- [sighs] You're crazy.
- [chuckles]

1590
01:22:00.875 --> 01:22:01.916
[Azra sighs]

1591
01:22:03.208 --> 01:22:04.208
Okay, found it.

1592
01:22:05.750 --> 01:22:07.875
[Duygu sighs] Come on, Azra.

1593
01:22:11.625 --> 01:22:12.625
It's on.

1594
01:22:13.083 --> 01:22:15.958
Wow, that is a lot of Duygus.

1595
01:22:16.625 --> 01:22:17.833
"Alparslan."

1596
01:22:19.291 --> 01:22:20.291
Yes, got it.

1597
01:22:21.000 --> 01:22:22.000
[sighs]

1598
01:22:23.083 --> 01:22:25.375
- [Cansu sighs] Yeah!
- [laughing] She found it!

1599
01:22:25.458 --> 01:22:26.500
POLICE

1600
01:22:26.583 --> 01:22:27.958
[chattering]

1601
01:22:28.041 --> 01:22:30.041
[Azra] Yeah, don't worry.
Hande is all fine.

1602
01:22:30.541 --> 01:22:32.083
We're about to take her home now.

1603
01:22:32.166 --> 01:22:34.208
You two should go home too, all right?

1604
01:22:34.791 --> 01:22:36.291
Okay, I'll see you soon.

1605
01:22:37.458 --> 01:22:38.500
[exhales]

1606
01:22:38.583 --> 01:22:40.833
We make a good team. Don't you think?

1607
01:22:40.916 --> 01:22:42.625
- I guess we do.
- [chuckles]

1608
01:22:42.708 --> 01:22:44.708
[indistinct chattering
over police scanner]

1609
01:22:50.833 --> 01:22:54.000
[Azra] Hande? Excuse me, officer.
Where are you taking her?

1610
01:22:54.083 --> 01:22:57.125
We need to take her statement
at the station. It won't take long.

1611
01:22:57.208 --> 01:22:59.000
The guys will drop her home
after that, miss.

1612
01:22:59.083 --> 01:23:02.375
No, if she's going, we're coming too.
We're not gonna leave Hande alone.

1613
01:23:03.083 --> 01:23:04.625
And who exactly are you?

1614
01:23:05.125 --> 01:23:08.208
- Um, we... we're her... uh...
- Yeah, we're her teachers.

1615
01:23:09.375 --> 01:23:11.416
We're both her teachers, aren't we?

1616
01:23:11.500 --> 01:23:12.833
- Yep, that's right.
- Hmm.

1617
01:23:14.333 --> 01:23:16.875
All right, then. You can follow us.
We'll meet at the station.

1618
01:23:16.958 --> 01:23:18.333
[Azra exhales]

1619
01:23:18.416 --> 01:23:19.625
Hande, if you please.

1620
01:23:24.416 --> 01:23:25.625
[Burak groans]

1621
01:23:26.875 --> 01:23:27.875
[Azra grunts softly]

1622
01:23:33.208 --> 01:23:34.583
Up for coffee?

1623
01:23:36.833 --> 01:23:38.958
[grunts] But so late?

1624
01:23:42.416 --> 01:23:45.916
What else is there to do this late,

1625
01:23:46.000 --> 01:23:47.375
than have some coffee?

1626
01:23:47.458 --> 01:23:49.791
[slow-tempo music playing]

1627
01:23:49.875 --> 01:23:52.000
[vocalizing]

1628
01:23:55.750 --> 01:23:57.666
- [door opens]
- [Azra] Oh.

1629
01:23:59.791 --> 01:24:00.791
[both] It's us!

1630
01:24:00.875 --> 01:24:02.291
[chuckling]

1631
01:24:08.541 --> 01:24:09.750
[Azra laughs]

1632
01:24:26.875 --> 01:24:27.875
[exhales]

1633
01:24:31.500 --> 01:24:32.708
[chuckles]

1634
01:24:37.166 --> 01:24:39.250
[Azra] <i>What do you think
is the meaning of life?</i>

1635
01:24:40.000 --> 01:24:41.041
<i>Curiosity?</i>

1636
01:24:42.708 --> 01:24:43.791
<i>Joy?</i>

1637
01:24:45.916 --> 01:24:47.125
<i>Fun?</i>

1638
01:24:50.500 --> 01:24:51.500
<i>Love?</i>

1639
01:24:54.375 --> 01:24:56.958
<i>We're all pupils in search of ourselves,</i>

1640
01:24:57.666 --> 01:24:58.958
<i>but sometimes,</i>

1641
01:24:59.708 --> 01:25:01.375
<i>in order to find yourself,</i>

1642
01:25:01.458 --> 01:25:03.041
<i>you must lose it first.</i>

1643
01:25:05.833 --> 01:25:08.875
<i>And sometimes,
you find yourself in someone else.</i>

1644
01:25:09.875 --> 01:25:12.208
<i>And your story is then complete.</i>

1645
01:25:14.333 --> 01:25:16.791
<i>You already know. I'm Azra.</i>

1646
01:25:16.875 --> 01:25:19.041
<i>I give private lessons to young people.</i>

1647
01:25:19.125 --> 01:25:21.875
<i>They pick the subject,
and I teach what I can.</i>

1648
01:25:25.208 --> 01:25:27.008
- You all look very pretty.
- [women laughing]

1649
01:25:27.083 --> 01:25:29.333
Yes, loving your energy.
Just one last time?

1650
01:25:30.083 --> 01:25:33.416
- Wonderful. Hande, what are you doing?
- I'll be right back. Be right back.

1651
